Edouw
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 79 ROTATE 1 2 U
JUIVI 1 FACE_HALF
JUIVI 4 FACE_HALF
JUIVI 8 FACE_HALF
JUIVI 5 FACE_HALF
JUIVI 7 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE JUIVI JUIVI
OR
    DEST Size > 3
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
MOVE_STACK JUIVI JUIVI
OR
    AND
        SRCSTACK Size <= 8
        SRCSTACK Rank add_14
    AND
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS}
        SRCSTACK Rank equal
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
